---
const { compact = false } = Astro.props
---
<aside class:list={['booking-assistance-notice', { compact }]} aria-label="About our booking assistance">
  <p><strong>Visiting Kenya?</strong> Karibu! If you need help booking an SGR seat, especially if you don’t have M-Pesa, we’re happy to help you book an available seat through Kenya Railways.</p>
  <p><strong>To our fellow Kenyans who’ve already checked and found their train full:</strong> Tafadhali, we know how much that journey can mean. We do not sell tickets or hold extra seats. If your train is fully booked on <a href="https://metickets.krc.co.ke/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">metickets.krc.co.ke</a>, we can’t book it either. Please try another time or date.</p>
</aside>
<style>
  .booking-assistance-notice { margin:20px 0 0; padding:20px 24px; border:1px solid #e5d6b4; border-left:4px solid #986529; border-radius:10px; background:#fff9ed; color:#394b3e; }
  .booking-assistance-notice p { margin:8px 0 0; font-size:.84rem; line-height:1.7; }
  .booking-assistance-notice a { text-decoration:underline; text-underline-offset:3px; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
  .booking-assistance-notice.compact { margin:16px 0; padding:14px 16px; }
  .booking-assistance-notice.compact p { margin:0; font-size:.8rem; }
  .booking-assistance-notice.compact p + p { margin-top:8px; }
  @media(max-width:560px) { .booking-assistance-notice { padding:16px; } }
</style>
